    "explanation": "Q1 counts only non-NULL values of T2.circuitId after the join, while Q2 counts all rows after the join. If there are races with NULL circuitId values that join with circuits (possible if the foreign key constraint allows NULLs), Q1 will exclude those rows from the count while Q2 will include them.",
